              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["AD","DB","AC","CB"] },
            { text: "for both are rational,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["AD","DB","AC","CB"] },
            { text: "therefore the sum of the squares on {AC} and {CB} also differs",
